.SH NAME
zone \- a table in the xCAT database.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBzone Attributes:\fR  \fIzonename\fR, \fIsshkeydir\fR, \fIsshbetweennodes\fR, \fIdefaultzone\fR, \fIcomments\fR, \fIdisable\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
Defines a cluster zone for nodes that share root ssh key access to each other.
.SH "zone Attributes:"
.IX Header "zone Attributes:"
.IP \fBzonename\fR 10
.IX Item "zonename"
The name of the zone.
.IP \fBsshkeydir\fR 10
.IX Item "sshkeydir"
Directory containing the shared root ssh RSA keys.
.IP \fBsshbetweennodes\fR 10
.IX Item "sshbetweennodes"
Indicates whether passwordless ssh will be setup between the nodes of this zone. Values are yes/1 or no/0. Default is yes.
.IP \fBdefaultzone\fR 10
.IX Item "defaultzone"
If nodes are not assigned to any other zone, they will default to this zone. If value is set to yes or 1.
.IP \fBcomments\fR 10
.IX Item "comments"
Any user-provided notes.
.IP \fBdisable\fR 10
.IX Item "disable"
Set to 'yes' or '1' to comment out this row.
